{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/7nypx8bck1exete6eb9e3zauhshnnln.mp3","text":"早——上——好，博......士，啊，那我把睡袋放这儿，接下来，我就继续睡了，麻——烦——你——了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/2w1roc4fgwthgau6sleoz7nvv5wte3s.mp3","text":"我的战斗方式？当然是用法术来战斗吧。让我来向你展示，大地的威严。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/cwolb9e1r3au8a8qsppcl4tusly20b1.mp3","text":"现在几点啊......？其实，早晨，中午，下午和晚上，都是我的非工作时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/4rdc4gryl8dl1to1mk65k9rl4rxtr3e.mp3","text":"要帮我定制小号制服？不——要，大号制服在睡觉的时候能当被子，很——暖和。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_004.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/1ll2htqn4yijwlnp45hqn1mgge1xey4.mp3","text":"博——士——我——请假！因为我，已经被邀请参加速睡大赛啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/p2xugn4e1rbp5jtogvtp8s3x06xm2zw.mp3","text":"博士，来看看这个。这可不是我平时用的法杖，它是一枚钟摆。接下来博士会在五分钟之内睡着，不会给我安排任何工作......Zzzz......","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/gpzz3axoivbg0xbq4cm4e2ry6aphvtg.mp3","text":"唉，可以，和博士您聊聊我的故乡吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/c8ocsgsej4p9hmjz0g0yutvibdtflfn.mp3","text":"好不容易把博士哄睡着了，我......竟然一点都不困了，可......恶......","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/qiadivxxvldtxvyqkc8vd5z3equlgoa.mp3","text":"喂——喂！能听到我说话吗？低头看下面啦！初次见面，大个子的博士，我是术师，杜林哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/qu2tkkl56eyl2zzi9ibalnymwriyu2f.mp3","text":"啊——我·终·于·变·强·啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_012.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/3o89ejlbhjh711a75iwa4a1gl89lh16.mp3","text":"健康的秘诀，是好好睡觉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/faeb97z8infjlzdnsw2n42wchee2o7y.mp3","text":"这是队长命令，各位，现在就开始打盹，补充体力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/a6p175bza68cab62yka016mjr5bv4vh.mp3","text":"如果可以的话，我想在地上挖个洞当掩体，用来睡觉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/do97rxxgfpjhv0wla56frsjabj66n9d.mp3","text":"各位，拜托你们喽。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/ai4g3tcsth0i3oo866l2c0td2ky2fze.mp3","text":"哦，哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/lblnvdjufhjkkiw2ha2go712zouho4n.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/fxq01ywol45jythskkuc1no33xnd2b8.mp3","text":"真麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/86lo9bc0ju1rjgqud7vou1k5c0ndie3.mp3","text":"我知道啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/ikog2nd1rv4kio5t68n2tc5vro1tj3c.mp3","text":"打倒你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/dsjp82l3q0fwz7yep2fc83hmfuj3zk9.mp3","text":"去吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/r45w7mg7z0bykp0arewyylzaflxi64u.mp3","text":"干嘛要来处理这么棘手的目标啊？轻轻松松的不是更好嘛！还好赢了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/dfpuyicjtgegp1gw44hvgvpy84v9gsz.mp3","text":"胜利，理所当然，在背后默默地用法术支援你们的可是我啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/i96ippg9wmd7ycqu60szmqzuu3hu3xj.mp3","text":"博士，还在纠结放走了多少敌人吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/iko0dttmf1da71oh8l2nw891z0hexbh.mp3","text":"呜......对不起......下次我会认真战斗的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/mxwzcgj85a34sxmv68ogzfpdztcac7c.mp3","text":"巨人国......我来了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/6o94oyr0wndiexb9zp30nnyj444a24n.mp3","text":"咕？","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/3wkbk6mh1yn8d73sz5l59lqxcndp6pg.mp3","text":"现在我心情很好，给你变个魔术怎么样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/eojp8xwajgqu0sk5fedyd0r10fvbepr.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_501_durin/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/fz1439my6qlj0llipmnhvc889i21puk.mp3","text":"新年快乐呀大个子博士。食堂准备了好——多好吃的，博士有好好吃饭吗？对了，我刚刚看到桃金娘拿着一个大口袋去食堂了，但她来迟咯，所有的芝士炸羽兽都被